  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday through Friday)\nIssued at 100 PM MDT Sat Jul 25 2026\n\nMonday thru Friday will feature a typical late July monsoon pattern \nwith the upper level high migrating westward across northern NM to \nthe Four Corners region by late week. Daily rounds of showers and \nstorms will develop over the higher terrain then move into nearby \nlowlands on convective outflows. High PWATs and slow storm motion \nwill still allow for locally heavy rainfall amounts >1.5\". Northern \nand western NM will be favored in this pattern with differences in \nthe overall coverage and intensity varying from day to day.",
